{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_83832dc95e4684d1ea9a6a56", "claim_ids": ["claim_30741294147bcb3896c03dd3", "claim_aee076bb1ba690d185e39e6b"], "query_ids": ["q_89"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_30741294147bcb3896c03dd3", "quote": "All General Approved Exclusions (GAEs) and country-level ‘alternative arrangements’ to the Section 232 Steel and Aluminum Duties (including exemptions, absolute quotas, and tariff-rate quotas) were revoked effective 12:01 AM Eastern Time on March 12, 2025.", "url": "https://www.bis.gov/about-bis/bis-leadership-and-offices/SIES/section-232-investigations/section-232-steel-aluminum", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 Steel and Aluminum Duties"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_aee076bb1ba690d185e39e6b", "quote": "Updated 6/11/2025. If the steel and/or aluminum derivative is classified in one of the new HTS classifications subject to Section 232 steel and/or aluminum derivatives duties on or after March 12, 2025, and the good is made exclusively from steel melted and poured in the United States, or exclusively made from aluminum smelted and cast in the United States, then the good is not subject to Section 232 steel and/or aluminum duties.", "url": "https://www.cbp.gov/trade/programs-administration/entry-summary/232-tariffs-aluminum-and-steel-faqs", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232", "effective_date": "March 12, 2025"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_57184b7231886e8f92aa550d", "claim_ids": ["claim_6c6625ca2517f2a156606c81", "claim_9d5e7a328901372a1c7b8fa3"], "query_ids": ["q_90"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_6c6625ca2517f2a156606c81", "quote": "The tariffs do not stack with each other", "url": "https://www.whitecase.com/insight-alert/united-states-modifies-steel-aluminum-and-copper-section-232-tariffs", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9d5e7a328901372a1c7b8fa3", "quote": "The 3 June and 31 July guidances state that Section 232 steel, aluminium and copper tariffs and other additional tariffs can now apply to the same product based on its content. Section 232 tariffs now only apply to the metal content of imported products.", "url": "https://globaltradealert.org/blog/US-Tariff-Stacking-Explained", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 steel, aluminium and copper tariffs"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_faa6a0590fa11d52c10cb9ae", "claim_ids": ["claim_773494de891f3d49f8a19f7e", "claim_9d5e7a328901372a1c7b8fa3"], "query_ids": ["q_90"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_773494de891f3d49f8a19f7e", "quote": "Goods listed as articles or derivatives of more than one of these metals will only be subject to one of the tariff rates specified above (i.e., no tariff stacking).", "url": "https://www.strtrade.com/trade-news-resources/tariff-actions-resources/section-232-tariffs-on-steel-aluminum", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}, {"claim_id": "claim_9d5e7a328901372a1c7b8fa3", "quote": "The 3 June and 31 July guidances state that Section 232 steel, aluminium and copper tariffs and other additional tariffs can now apply to the same product based on its content. Section 232 tariffs now only apply to the metal content of imported products.", "url": "https://globaltradealert.org/blog/US-Tariff-Stacking-Explained", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 232 steel, aluminium and copper tariffs"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_62254e3db3c831a162d59512", "claim_ids": ["claim_00df240b51dc1d7fcd5fae0b", "claim_ece89ea9b5ffb93cca3d1bb0"], "query_ids": ["q_91"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_00df240b51dc1d7fcd5fae0b", "quote": "On February 16, 2026, Mexico’s Ministry of Economy published a notice in Mexico’s Official Gazette initiating an antidumping investigation on cold rolled steel from the United States, Malaysia, and China, and a countervailing duty investigation on cold rolled steel from the United States, regardless of country of shipment.", "url": "https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/mexico-metals-cold-rolled-steel-antidumping-and-countervailing-duty-initiation", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"tariff_program": "antidumping investigation", "legal_authority": "Mexico’s Ministry of Economy", "announcement_date": "February 16, 2026"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ece89ea9b5ffb93cca3d1bb0", "quote": "This investigation is relevant for U.S. exporters because it could lead to additional duties on the covered products and because Mexico is running both an antidumping and a countervailing duty investigation on U.S. origin products.", "url": "https://www.trade.gov/market-intelligence/mexico-metals-cold-rolled-steel-antidumping-and-countervailing-duty-initiation", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"country_of_origin": "U.S. origin"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_4bfc1b73367d31b28b94f6a4", "claim_ids": ["claim_004e0601feb5f9a9bfc6f6b2", "claim_72be9cb07786374df1f5898b"], "query_ids": ["q_92"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_004e0601feb5f9a9bfc6f6b2", "quote": "countervailing duties will be applied to India at 336.62% to 360.23%", "url": "https://www.steelradar.com/en/haber/usa-imposes-anti-dumping-and-countervailing-duties-on-hot-rolled-steel-imports-from-multiple-countries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "336.62% to 360.23%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_72be9cb07786374df1f5898b", "quote": "countervailing duties will be applied to India at 336.62% to 360.23%, Indonesia at 10.21%, and Thailand at 2.38%", "url": "https://www.steelradar.com/en/haber/usa-imposes-anti-dumping-and-countervailing-duties-on-hot-rolled-steel-imports-from-multiple-countries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "10.21%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_d20ff50139f66e9a08c72d00", "claim_ids": ["claim_04418145d37e9bf590135e80", "claim_1d4e837ed72f6d1865bd0b4f"], "query_ids": ["q_92"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_04418145d37e9bf590135e80", "quote": "47.86% on Indonesia, 20.30% on Thailand, 90.33% on Ukraine, and 29.14% on Taiwan", "url": "https://www.steelradar.com/en/haber/usa-imposes-anti-dumping-and-countervailing-duties-on-hot-rolled-steel-imports-from-multiple-countries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "47.86%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_1d4e837ed72f6d1865bd0b4f", "quote": "20.30% on Thailand, 90.33% on Ukraine, and 29.14% on Taiwan", "url": "https://www.steelradar.com/en/haber/usa-imposes-anti-dumping-and-countervailing-duties-on-hot-rolled-steel-imports-from-multiple-countries", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "20.30%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_fe7a4117bdfc6b1ff43603ba", "claim_ids": ["claim_16d42f8c39f931710ee0cd23", "claim_4a5f0cc468b5cace55db2d7e"], "query_ids": ["q_92"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_16d42f8c39f931710ee0cd23", "quote": "The trade case, filed by six U.S. steel companies last August, charges producers in Australia, Brazil, Japan, Korea, the Netherlands, Turkey and the United Kingdom with violating international trade regulations by improperly subsidizing their steel producers and by dumping hot-rolled steel at below market prices in the U.S. market.", "url": "https://usw.org/press-release/usw-praises-doc-for-duties-on-hot-rolled-steel-imports", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "six U.S. steel companies", "country_of_origin": "Australia, Brazil, Japan, Korea, the Netherlands, Turkey and the United Kingdom", "exporting_country": "Australia, Brazil, Japan, Korea, the Netherlands, Turkey and the United Kingdom", "duty_rate": "7.42 percent", "effective_date": "preliminary determination", "reported_policy_status": "preliminary determination"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_4a5f0cc468b5cace55db2d7e", "quote": "The duty margins indicate hot-rolled steel imports were being sold at a price that is either below the cost of producing the product, or sold at a price below that producer’s domestic price.", "url": "https://usw.org/press-release/usw-praises-doc-for-duties-on-hot-rolled-steel-imports", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "3.97-7.33 percent for Korea to 49.05 percent for United Kingdom", "reported_policy_status": "preliminary finding"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_c8b15f4068d7e79cc7a01f29", "claim_ids": ["claim_14a366d30d8a416dcf5b8539", "claim_177240169061dac999e95f24"], "query_ids": ["q_94"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_14a366d30d8a416dcf5b8539", "quote": "Tariffs generally mirror the 25% rate for primary steel, but exemptions or quotas may apply based on country-specific agreements.", "url": "https://www.ctp-inc.com/articles/tariffs-on-steel-derivative-products", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_177240169061dac999e95f24", "quote": "10% tariff on full value of derivatives composed of at least 85% U.S.-sourced steel, aluminum, and copper", "url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IN12519", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "10%"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_1b367e34648d2b411e2ed098", "claim_ids": ["claim_177240169061dac999e95f24", "claim_246876ecf4718e8245c6880f"], "query_ids": ["q_94"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_177240169061dac999e95f24", "quote": "10% tariff on full value of derivatives composed of at least 85% U.S.-sourced steel, aluminum, and copper", "url": "https://www.congress.gov/crs-product/IN12519", "kind": "search_snippet", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"duty_rate": "10%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_246876ecf4718e8245c6880f", "quote": "The tariff applies only to the steel content of the product, not the entire value of the imported article.", "url": "https://www.ctp-inc.com/articles/tariffs-on-steel-derivative-products", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_c3d60899c71f410bec749d95", "claim_ids": ["claim_6b71a77ceb08aeaacdfea259", "claim_70449800b50b55bef7389693"], "query_ids": ["q_97"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_6b71a77ceb08aeaacdfea259", "quote": "The U.S. Department of Commerce (Commerce) is rescinding the administrative review of the antidumping duty (AD) order on non- oriented electrical steel (NOES) from Japan covering the period of review (POR) December 1, 2024, through November 30, 2025.", "url": "https://www.tyllus.com/en/resources/us-import-evidence-change-radar/2026-18089", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"company": "U.S. Department of Commerce", "tariff_program": "antidumping duty (AD) order", "affected_product": "non- oriented electrical steel (NOES)", "effective_date": "December 1, 2024", "expiration_date": "November 30, 2025", "reported_policy_status": "rescinding the administrative review"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_70449800b50b55bef7389693", "quote": "Commerce hereby orders the continuation of the Orders.", "url": "https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2026/05/18/2026-09826/non-oriented-electrical-steel-from-sweden-germany-the-peoples-republic-of-china-the-republic-of", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "official_trade_authority", "fields": {"legal_authority": "section 751(d)(2) of the Act", "effective_date": "May 13, 2026"}}]}]}

